---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ToolMapDemo from '../components/demos/ToolMapDemo.astro';
---
<Base title="Custom Integrations & Software" description="Custom integrations, workflow automation and custom software for small and mid-size businesses. We connect the tools you already use, with approval on anything sensitive. Scoped and quoted separately." current="services">
<section aria-labelledby="h1" style="padding:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) 0 clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px)">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,64px)"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><a href="/services">Services</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><span aria-current="page" style="color:#585E5A">Custom Integrations &amp; Software</span></nav>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,420px),1fr));gap:clamp(40px,6vw,80px);align-items:center">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px">
<p style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60"><span style="width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:#E6E0F5;color:#5B3E9A;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#5B3E9A">hub</span></span>Custom work · scoped and quoted separately</p>
<h1 id="h1" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance">Custom integrations and software</h1>
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(20px,2vw,24px);line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#0F4C45;text-wrap:balance">Your tools, working together. Your process, built into software.</p>
<p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:58ch">We connect the systems you already use, so information moves between them without copy and paste. When off-the-shelf tools don't fit, we build custom software around how you work. Every project is scoped and quoted separately.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:8px"><a class="x1" href="/book-a-discovery-call?solve=Connecting%20our%20systems%20or%20custom%20software" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:52px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s,box-shadow .15s">Book a Discovery Call</a><a class="x2" href="#demo" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:52px;padding:0 28px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid #0F4C45;color:#0F4C45;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;text-decoration:none;transition:background .15s">Map your tools</a></div>
</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 24px 64px rgba(15,76,69,.10),0 2px 6px rgba(26,33,31,.05);overflow:hidden">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6;background:#F5F1EA"><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#DED5C6"></span><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#DED5C6"></span><span style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#DED5C6"></span><span style="font-size:13px;color:#585E5A;margin-left:12px">Connections</span><span style="flex:1"></span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:24px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#F7ECD6;color:#7A4E00;font-weight:600;font-size:12px">Sample data</span></div>
<div style="padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px">
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px"><div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><b style="font-size:17px">Job completed</b><p style="font-size:14px;color:#585E5A">Starts when your team marks a job done in your scheduling tool</p></div><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;height:28px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#E5F0E8;color:#1E6B3E;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#1E6B3E">verified</span>Tested before go-live</span></div>
<ol style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<li style="display:flex;gap:14px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid #EEE8DE"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:22px;color:#0F4C45">contacts</span><div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><b style="font-size:15px">Client record updated</b><p style="font-size:14px;color:#585E5A">Your CRM · instantly</p></div><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;height:28px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#E5F0E8;color:#1E6B3E;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#1E6B3E">check</span>Done</span></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:14px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid #EEE8DE"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:22px;color:#0F4C45">receipt_long</span><div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><b style="font-size:15px">Draft invoice for Dana R.</b><p style="font-size:14px;color:#585E5A">Your accounting tool · instantly</p></div><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;height:28px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#F7ECD6;color:#7A4E00;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#7A4E00">schedule</span>Waiting for approval</span></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:14px;padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid #EEE8DE"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:22px;color:#0F4C45">notifications</span><div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><b style="font-size:15px">Team notified</b><p style="font-size:14px;color:#585E5A">Your team inbox · instantly</p></div><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;height:28px;padding:0 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#E5F0E8;color:#1E6B3E;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#1E6B3E">check</span>Done</span></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="ps-h" style="background:#F0ECF8;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:48px"><h2 id="ps-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Problems it solves</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Three everyday problems custom work takes off your plate.</p></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:24px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">The problem</p><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Your team copies the same details between tools</h3><div style="height:1px;background:#DED5C6"></div><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">What changes</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Information moves between your systems on its own.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">The problem</p><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Client details are scattered across spreadsheets, email and notes</h3><div style="height:1px;background:#DED5C6"></div><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">What changes</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">One connected record your whole team can rely on.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A">The problem</p><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Off-the-shelf software doesn't fit how you work</h3><div style="height:1px;background:#DED5C6"></div><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">What changes</p><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Software built around your process, not the other way around.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="build" aria-labelledby="build-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0;scroll-margin-top:80px">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<h2 id="build-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:48px">What we build</h2>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:24px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><span style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:#E6E0F5;color:#5B3E9A;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#5B3E9A">hub</span></span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Custom integrations</h3><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We connect your existing systems to each other and to your Hazirminds services, so a change in one shows up in the others.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><span style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:#E6E0F5;color:#5B3E9A;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#5B3E9A">account_tree</span></span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Advanced automation and workflow redesign</h3><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We map how work actually moves through your business, then remove the manual steps between "yes" and "done".</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(28px,3.5vw,40px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><span style="width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:#E6E0F5;color:#5B3E9A;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#5B3E9A">code</span></span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:24px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">Custom software</h3><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">When no ready-made tool fits, we build one around the way your team works, and connect it to the rest of your system.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<ToolMapDemo />

<section aria-labelledby="lane-h" style="background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#DCE7E4">Control</p><h2 id="lane-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-wrap:balance">Connected, and still in your control</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#DCE7E4;max-width:44ch">Every connection runs on rules you approve.</p><a href="/security" style="color:#FAF7F2;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;margin-top:8px">Security &amp; data protection →</a></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">rule</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">We connect only what solves a real problem, and tell you what you don't need.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">how_to_reg</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">Anything that changes money, records or a promise to a customer waits for a person's approval.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">science</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">Every connection is tested before it touches a real customer or job.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">history</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">Each automated step is logged, so you can see what moved, and when.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#D6A552">lock</span><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.55">Your data stays yours, in your own isolated environment.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="how-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<h2 id="how-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:48px">How we work</h2>
<ol style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,240px),1fr));gap:24px">
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #2B5C8F"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#2B5C8F;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">1</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Understand</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We learn how work moves through your business today, and where it gets stuck.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #8A5A00"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#8A5A00;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">2</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Identify</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We find the connections and tools that would genuinely save your team time.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #A23E1E"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#A23E1E;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">3</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Start Small</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We build one right-sized piece first, and test it before it goes live.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding-top:24px;border-top:2px solid #0F6B57"><span style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#0F6B57;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:700;font-size:17px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center">4</span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Grow</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">We measure the results, then expand based on what you actually need next.</p></li>
</ol>
<p style="display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A;margin-top:40px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#585E5A">info</span><span>Every project is quoted as a fixed price after assessment and requirements gathering, and work starts only after you approve it. <a href="/pricing">How pricing works</a></span></p>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="faq-h" style="background:#F0ECF8;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div class="faq-cols" style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h2 id="faq-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Custom integration questions</h2><a href="/faq?topic=custom" style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px">See all questions →</a></div>
<div style="min-width:0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6">
<details open="" style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x3" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">How is custom work priced?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">Each project is quoted as a fixed price, after we assess your needs and gather your requirements. Work starts only after you approve the quote.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x4" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Do we have to replace the software we use now?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">Usually not. Much of the value comes from connecting and properly setting up the tools you already have. If something genuinely needs replacing, we'll tell you why.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x5" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Can you connect to any tool?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">Not always. It depends on what each tool allows. We review your tools on the first call and tell you honestly what can connect.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x6" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Will anything happen without our approval?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">No. Connections run on rules you approve, and anything sensitive or consequential waits for a person.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x7" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Who owns the custom software?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">Unless your agreement says otherwise, you own what we build specifically for you once it's paid in full, apart from our own platform technology. Your data is always yours.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x8" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Where will it be hosted?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">On our managed AWS hosting in the US by default, in your own isolated environment, or on your own server if you prefer. A self-hosted setup is scoped separately.</p></details>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="cta-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
